otek-perfex-linux-tracker (1.0.6) stable; urgency=medium

  * Remembers the last project and task: reopening the app (or logging in
    again) selects the project/task you last worked on. Saved when you
    pick from either dropdown and when you start tracking. If the saved
    project no longer exists in the CRM, it falls back to the first entry.

