otek-perfex-linux-tracker (1.0.5) stable; urgency=medium

  * Added a refresh button next to the Project label that re-fetches the
    project list (and tasks) without restarting the app, so projects an
    admin adds while the app is open show up. The current project/task
    stay selected if they still exist. Disabled while tracking, like the
    dropdowns.

